  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "When running a clean build on master, the victi.ms enforcer plugin is reporting a vulnerability in the commons-httpclient library that is a dependency of the fcrepo-integration-rdf module.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "[WARNING] The dependency commons-httpclient-3.1 matches a vulnerability recorded in the victims database. [CVE-2012-5783]\r\n[WARNING] Rule 0: com.redhat.victims.VictimsRule failed with message:+=======================+\r\n|VULNERABILITY DETECTED!|\r\n+=======================+\r\nFor more information visit:\r\n  - https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2012-5783",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    }
